<title>USA: Lexington Global to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Lexington Global to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lexington Global Asset Managers Inc said Friday it will buy back up to 750,000 shares in three years.</p>
<p>Lexington Global has about 5.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Spun off from Peidmont Management Co Inc, Lexington went public on Dec 13, 1995.</p>
